msgid "API Timeout (sec)"
msgstr "API-Timeout (Sek.)"

#: inputs/kma_weather_forecast.py:206
msgid "Set the API response timeout (default 60 sec)."
msgstr "Legt das Timeout für API-Antworten fest (Standard: 60 Sek.)."

